# THE CODE IS IN GIT; THE DATA IS NOT, AND THIS IS WHERE THAT LINE IS DRAWN.
#
# Everything here is derived and re-buildable from the fetched sources named in
# _paths.py, and all of it is large: the located-item corpus is 126 MB, the join
# dump 111 MB, the index 42 MB. Under a default CITY_DATA none of these paths is
# even inside the repo — they resolve into scratchpad/sf-city-anim/blocks/ — and
# these rules exist so that a build run with BLOCKS_OUT pointed here by accident
# cannot commit 200 MB of intermediates.
cache/
out/
out_*/
__pycache__/

# Working copies of the builder. `git log build_index.py` is the history.
*.pre-*
*.bak
